                "text": "Just imagine you are in line, waiting for what could be your first meal in days. Instead of food, you, your loved ones, and your neighbors are killed. Hundreds of others are severely injured. \n\nHow can we sleep knowing that our government is complicit in these horrors? We need to commit to a #CeasefireNOW!",
